<article class="wrap" style="max-width:760px; padding-top:56px; padding-bottom:96px;">
  <div style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; color:var(--ink);">
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">This Privacy Policy explains what information Flightline Review collects when you use flightlinereview.com ("the Site"), and how that information is used.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Information We Collect</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">When you submit our contact form, we collect the name, email address, subject, and message you provide. We do not require an account to browse the Site, and we do not knowingly collect personal information beyond what you voluntarily submit.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">How We Use Information</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">Information submitted through the contact form is used only to respond to your message, follow up on tips or story ideas, and for internal editorial purposes. We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Cookies</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">The Site may use cookies or similar technologies for basic functionality and, if enabled in the future, for analytics purposes to understand how visitors use the Site. You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings at any time. Disabling cookies may affect some functionality of the Site.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Third-Party Services</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">The Site is hosted and its contact form is processed by third-party service providers, which may process data in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Your Rights</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, or request deletion of personal information you've submitted to us. To make such a request, contact us using the details below.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Children's Privacy</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">The Site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Changes to This Policy</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h3 style="font-family:var(--serif); font-size:22px; margin:32px 0 12px;">Contact</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:22px;">Questions about this policy or requests regarding your information can be sent to <a href="mailto:Contact@flightlinereview.com" style="color:var(--rust);">Contact@flightlinereview.com</a>.</p>
